ipedia, “Large language model”. This file deliberately mixes formatting to exercise filters.</g></source><seg-source><g id="6"><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Source text:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Wikipedia, “Large language model”.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">This file deliberately mixes formatting to exercise filters.</mrk></g></seg-source><target><g id="6"><mrk mtype="seg" mid="4">Source text:</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="5">Wikipedia, “Large language model”.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="6">This file deliberately mixes formatting to exercise filters.</mrk></g></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="4" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">jp3IpETkqZGmz2WVMZ7Yc4aRVeeFhx2OImvg29RdNmw=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="5" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">4G9ikv7uYSOIVJJdfjroJ+VaHja3umP6NP/HA388BA4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="6" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FjNo8lIo6jGcYcrxRgEIfd9t8hG9Jzh+KdoWDmCM53c=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="8"/><sdl:cxt id="9"/><sdl:node id="4"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="8797d298-78c3-4de0-bd70-e07adf193d1b"><source>1. Inline formatting &amp; special characters</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Inline formatting &amp; special characters</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="7">1.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="8">Inline formatting &amp; special characters</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="7" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="lt0gMAmRKVz4T4QWCSUvW4o3GhzvA1aw6eqIRMk2IPM="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lt0gMAmRKVz4T4QWCSUvW4o3GhzvA1aw6eqIRMk2IPM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="8" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Z88GVM08sQXqKTg2vLQjBqroqSsWPXD5Td7Txr7Fg1k=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="11"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="e823ffc6-ebb4-44c4-8ad0-bf12ccf74698"><source>A large language model (LLM) is a neural network trained on a vast amount of text for natural language processing tasks, especially language generation. LLMs can typically generate, summarize, translate and analyze text in many contexts, and are a foundational technology behind modern chatbots. Biased or inaccurate training data can make an LLM&apos;s output less reliable. <g id="9">Bold</g>, <g id="12">italic</g>, <g id="15">underline</g>, <g id="18">H2O subscript</g>, <g id="21">E=mc2 superscript</g>, <g id="24">coloured</g>.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">A large language model (LLM) is a neural network trained on a vast amount of text for natural language processing tasks, especially language generation.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">LLMs can typically generate, summarize, translate and analyze text in many contexts, and are a foundational technology behind modern chatbots.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Biased or inaccurate training data can make an LLM&apos;s output less reliable.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><g id="9">Bold</g>, <g id="12">italic</g>, <g id="15">underline</g>, <g id="18">H2O subscript</g>, <g id="21">E=mc2 superscript</g>, <g id="24">coloured</g>.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="9">A large language model (LLM) is a neural network trained on a vast amount of text for natural language processing tasks, especially language generation.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="10">LLMs can typically generate, summarize, translate and analyze text in many contexts, and are a foundational technology behind modern chatbots.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="11">Biased or inaccurate training data can make an LLM&apos;s output less reliable.</mrk> <mrk mtype="seg" mid="12"><g id="9">Bold</g>, <g id="12">italic</g>, <g id="15">underline</g>, <g id="18">H2O subscript</g>, <g id="21">E=mc2 superscript</g>, <g id="24">coloured</g>.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="9" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Mi6Q31do0hjaCFXulYEeSQsk