id="96">Costs</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="95" origin="source"><sdl:rep id="lt0gMAmRKVz4T4QWCSUvW4o3GhzvA1aw6eqIRMk2IPM="/><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">lt0gMAmRKVz4T4QWCSUvW4o3GhzvA1aw6eqIRMk2IPM=</sdl:value></sdl:seg><sdl:seg id="96" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">NdcZcwhJrTtHGYFOvsWreWh2TgKVOXMmjaUii3BvE+8=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="76"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="3c681dbf-13e2-41a3-99ce-0f090ddc7cb4"><source>The training of GPT-2 (a 1.5-billion-parameter model) in 2019 cost $50,000, while training of PaLM (a 540-billion-parameter model) in 2022 cost $8 million, and Megatron-Turing NLG 530B (in 2021) cost around $11 million.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="97">The training of GPT-2 (a 1.5-billion-parameter model) in 2019 cost $50,000, while training of PaLM (a 540-billion-parameter model) in 2022 cost $8 million, and Megatron-Turing NLG 530B (in 2021) cost around $11 million.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="97">The training of GPT-2 (a 1.5-billion-parameter model) in 2019 cost $50,000, while training of PaLM (a 540-billion-parameter model) in 2022 cost $8 million, and Megatron-Turing NLG 530B (in 2021) cost around $11 million.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="97" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">FPjiOieqtuMqIqwvvcF2IY97CA769o4RF6BUZ6vlhSs=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group><group><sdl:cxts><sdl:cxt id="77"/><sdl:cxt id="7"/></sdl:cxts><trans-unit id="15e03886-f1bb-451e-85e5-7e37579b4ba6"><source>Since 2023, many LLMs have been trained to be multimodal, having the ability to also process or generate other types of data, such as images, audio, or 3D meshes.</source><seg-source><mrk mtype="seg" mid="98">Since 2023, many LLMs have been trained to be multimodal, having the ability to also process or generate other types of data, such as images, audio, or 3D meshes.</mrk></seg-source><target><mrk mtype="seg" mid="98">Since 2023, many LLMs have been trained to be multimodal, having the ability to also process or generate other types of data, such as images, audio, or 3D meshes.</mrk></target><sdl:seg-defs><sdl:seg id="98" origin="source"><sdl:value key="SegmentIdentityHash">Frjnejsq6xpnHK1MnUZe9XLfkGZMw97cnQH/LZov1t4=</sdl:value></sdl:seg></sdl:seg-defs></trans-unit></group></body></file></xliff>